aries.</span></p><p style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 107%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><img src="https://nr.indianrailways.gov.in//uploads/images/1761194858714-Picture1.png" style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-size:="" 14pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""></p><p style="line-height: 107%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Dr. Parveen Sharma</span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">, Principal Chief Dental Surgeon and Head of the Dental Department, has about 39 years of experience in dentistry. She is an alumni of the pioneering batch of PGIDS Rohtak and did her postgraduate studies from GDC Amritsar. Although she uses her profound knowledge and expertise in imparting comprehensive dental care in all disciplines with dedication, she has special interest in exodontia, pedodontics and orthodontics. She is an ardent music lover.</span></font></p></div><div style=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Dr. </span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Naveeta</span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""> Mittal</span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">, ACDS, graduated in 1992 and has over 32 years of comprehensive experience in dentistry, augmented by a PG Diploma in Hospital Management. She is renowned for her expertise in esthetic and painless dentistry, fueled by her dedication to creating radiant smiles and significantly enhancing patient well-being through her gentle and empathetic approach. Her vibrant personality&nbsp; shines through her love for movies, sports, and dancing, reflecting her joyful and&nbsp; free-spirited natures.</span></font></div><div style=""><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></div><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Dr. Ashish Dixit</span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">, ACDS, graduated from the University of Mysore in 1993 and holds a Postgraduate Diploma in Public Policy and Management from IIM Bangalore. With 31 years of clinical experience, he specializes in conservative and esthetic dentistry while also excelling in hospital administration. Beyond his professional expertise,&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-size: small; font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Dr. Dixit is an avid enthusiast of photography, trekking, ornithology, and music.</span></p><div style=""><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></div><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 112,="" 192);="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Dr. Aarti Yadav</span><span style="font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">, Divisional Dental Surgeon, holds a&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-size: small; font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Bachelor's</span><span style="font-size: small; font-family: " century="" gothic";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""> in Dental Science and a PG Diploma in Hospital Management. With 14 years of experience, she is proficient in all facets of dentistry, with a particular passion for advanced endodontic and aesthetic techniques. Her role skillfully integrates clinical methods with strategic healthcare administration to enhance patient satisfaction. She enjoys solving Sudoku puzzles and playing badminton.</span></p><div style="font-size: 12px;"><br></div><span style="font-size: 12px;"><img src="https://nr.indianrailways.gov.in//uploads/images/1754224117422-Dental Surgery Schedule.png"></span></div>
